      "type": "Storage",
      "notes": "Store tightly sealed in a cool, dry place"
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: All Other",
      "notes": "Directions: Ortho Iron is formulated with the necessary cofactors to support iron absorption to help promote healthy iron levels."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Ortho Iron contains SunActiveFe, an award-winning patented form of iron recognized for its superior bioavailability and gastric tolerability."
    },
    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "Directions: Take 1 capsule daily with food, or as directed by a qualified health care practitioner. Take a few hours before or after taking other medications."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications",
      "notes": "Warning: Consult your physician before use if you are pregnant, lactating, have a medical condition, or are taking any medication."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Children",
      "notes": "Accidental overdose of iron-containing products is a leading cause of fatal poisoning in children under 6. Keep this product out of reach of children. In case of accidental overdose, call a doctor or poison control center immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: All Other",
      "notes": "Caution: Take a few hours before or after taking other medications. Taking a daily prenatal multivitamin or mineral supplement along with this product may result in constipation, diarrhea, and/or vomiting due to the high intake of iron."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Allergies",
      "notes": "Consult a health care practitioner prior to use if you are allergic to cow’s milk/dairy products."
    },
